    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been hired to work at a bar. But due to a serious staffing shortage, you\u2019re thrown into solo operation from day one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize all orders and serve cocktails quickly and accurately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With six challenging stages, the difficulty ramps up as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail to memorize multiple orders correctly, and customer frustration will skyrocket, leading to a game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese</p>",
